. * SOURCE/DEFINITION CHOICES -- change here if original estimation code is recov
> ered.
. * Fixed doses: initial amount, ln(amount), two equity ratios, capital share,
. * subsequent round count, ln(1+subsequent amount), ln(cumulative VD USD).
. * Subsequent and cumulative measures use full source follow-up: descriptive, po
> tentially endogenous
. * and forward-looking. They are NOT annual realized exposure or causal dose eff
> ects.
. * Prior patent and late stage moderators are fixed at the first VD year.
. * Lagged controls: prior patent dummy, late stage dummy, ln(1+cumulative fundin
> g),
. * ln(1+cumulative funding rounds). The original table does not establish +1 rul
> es.
. * Post includes the first VD calendar year. No event-window restriction imposed
> .
. * Missing controls/moderators/dose are excluded, never replaced by zero here.
. * Same complete-case sample across four columns WITHIN each table.
. * Do not restrict firms to observed pre AND post years; audit that coverage onl
> y.
. * All four columns use treated firms; columns 2/3 are interaction models, NOT s
> ubsets.
. * Firm FE + year FE; standard errors clustered at firm level.
. 
